  description:
  - When a structure is destroyed, it will occassionally leave behind a pile of rubble.
    Spending resources and completing a quick microgame will repair the structure.
    Otherwise, they can be removed via shoveling.
  - Structures destroyed by fire do not leave behind any piles.
